  "_how_to_edit": "Colors are hex codes. \"keywords\" are words in a headline that mean the story is about that company. Which companies get big sections, and their order, is set in layout.json. \"tvShows\" (weekly TV) and \"events\" (PPVs and premium live events) group numbers in the ticker. TV shows list Viewers, Tickets and Gate; events list Tickets, Gate and PPV buys, except WWE and NXT events, which list Tickets, Gate and Viewers since they stream instead of selling PPVs. \"showColors\" gives each show its own color in the ticker; shows without one use the company color. Optional \"bannerFrom\", \"bannerTo\", \"bannerText\", \"bannerName\" (company name color) and \"bannerBorder\" override a section banner's background and text colors. Optional \"logo\" is an image in the logos folder shown on the section banner in place of the company name.",
